description:
Design a 4-bit counter with a specific counting behavior. The counter increments its value on each positive clock edge; when it reaches 4, it resets to 9, and upon reaching 15, it wraps around back to 0. The current count value is output as a 4-bit wide signal.
module top_module(
    input clk,
    output reg [3:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input clk,
    output reg [3:0] out
);reg [3:0] count;

always @(posedge clk) begin
    if (count == 4) begin
        count <= 9;
    end else if (count == 15) begin
        count <= 0;
    end else begin
        count <= count + 1;
    end
end

assign out = count;

endmodule

